From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2026 13:48:59 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3286/5749] fix(config): clear stale context limit cache on
 provider updates

Rebuilding provider model limits prevents removed entries from leaking into later compaction decisions after config changes.

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
---
